 the catalog id, then post the review on that product: the AeroSound Wireless Headphones, the BrewMaster Electric Kettle. Then, from worklist `ship_replacement_wl1`, ship the warranty replacement unit: pick the real item (SKIP the superseded look-alike), then dereference its `spec` (get_op_spec) → `detail` (get_op_detail) → `final` (get_op_final) to read the concrete arguments, and act with those resolved values (never the worklist ref itself). None of these 3 streams depend on each other, so run them concurrently. For EVERY item: resolve each target FRESH by chaining through the records at the moment you act — never guess, and never reuse a value you read earlier.",
